      "statement": "import-irds and purge-irds are clap subcommands registered in src/main.rs; import-irds takes <IRDS>... plus -i/--info, -f/--force and --system, and accepts IRD version 9 only — any other version prints 'IRD version unsupported' after the metadata block and continues with the next file rather than failing the run.",
