    {
      "id": "claim_e76343421e9c4554811e629e92deda42",
      "statement": "parse_ird gates on the shared infer matcher (3IRD magic or gz) — anything else bails 'Not an IRD file' — then sequentially reads version, game ID, game name, the update/game/app versions, a gzip-compressed ISO header, a discarded footer, region hashes and files_count (sector LBA, MD5) pairs. files_hashes is therefore keyed by LBA rather than by name, and regions_hashes plus the footer are parsed but never used.",
