      "id": "claim_16b38e5fc04e43a79b1bbfbbfcde9512",
      "statement": "import_ird enumerates the embedded ISO tree in one scope before any await (Iso9660Filesystem is not Send), bails if the walked file count differs from the IRD's files_count, then upserts one roms row per disc path keyed by name within the game with the summed extent size, the MD5 looked up under the first extent's LBA, parent_id set to the chosen disc ROM and original = false.",
