      "id": "claim_67fe33d777224337aad9691dc6bda28e",
      "statement": "When a re-imported IRD changes a child rom's size or MD5, its romfile is detached and handed to reimport_orphan_romfiles — the same function DAT revisions use — which re-imports the file by content, moves it to the system Trash when it matches nothing, and then removes the directories it vacated via remove_empty_directories without ever deleting the ROM, system or Trash directories.",
